@startuml
!theme mars

title <size:18><b>Master Orchestrator Workflow - State Diagram</b></size>

[*] --> AnalyzeTask
AnalyzeTask --> DecomposeRequirements
DecomposeRequirements --> MapAgents : Identify Required\nExpertise

MapAgents --> ParallelExecution : Deploy Agent Pool

state ParallelExecution {
  [*] --> AutoDebugger
  [*] --> BackendAPI
  [*] --> FrontendElite
  [*] --> CloudArch
  [*] --> SecurityRT
  [*] --> TestRunner
  
  AutoDebugger : Bug Detection
  BackendAPI : API Development  
  FrontendElite : UI Architecture
  CloudArch : Infrastructure
  SecurityRT : Threat Analysis
  TestRunner : Quality Gates
}

ParallelExecution --> AggregateResults
AggregateResults --> ValidateQuality
ValidateQuality --> GenerateNarrative
GenerateNarrative --> [*]

note right of ParallelExecution
  **All agents run simultaneously**
  300-500% faster than sequential
end note

note right of ValidateQuality
  • Test coverage > 80%
  • Security score > 85
  • Performance benchmarks pass
  • Zero critical vulnerabilities
end note

@enduml
